ES:
Así que vas de pesca,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
¿eh, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Recuerda el refrán:{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} "Con paciencia
y una caña, se puede lograr más
de una hazaña".{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Bueno, no sé si es un refrán o
si me lo acabo de inventar,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

TRANSLATION:
Balık tutmaya mı gidiyorsun,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
Eski bir söz der ki,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} 'Hayattan
keyif almak istiyorsan balık
tutmayı öğren.'{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Demek sen hayatın keyfini
çoktan çıkarıyorsun,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Oo,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} Karahindiba tüyün var,
değil mi?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Hiç oynadın mı?
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Hafifçe üfle, tüyleri uçsun!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} {{TAG:0003:0004:}}
Havalanınca küçük dansçılar
gibi çok güzel görünüyorlar.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Willst du mich mit diesem Hammer
schlagen?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Wenn du dich dann besser fühlst...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Ich renne jedenfalls nicht weg!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Heh heh heh.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} You're so bold!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
Flagrantly announcing your
pitfall-related intentions{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}In a way,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} you're a gentleman, huh?
Thanks for the warning!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Hé hé.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} Un piège à nanas, hein ?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001C:}}Je pensais pas que t'aurais besoin
d'en arriver là, {{TAG:0005:0008:}} ! {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}Ha ha !

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Well, don't do too much damage to
the plants, OK?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} I've become friends
with a handful of flowers in town{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Bueno, vale,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} pero no me destroces
los geranios, que les he cogido
mucho cariño.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Ouais, ben, va pas te blesser, petit. {{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Et surtout, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}va pas creuser des trous
dans mon jardin, je t'ai à l'œil !

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Non rovinare troppo le piante, OK?
{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}Ci sono un sacco di fiori che coltivo
con amore da tanto tempo{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Pass bitte auf die Pflanzen auf, ja?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Hier gibt's 'ne Menge Blumen, die
ich regelmäßig pflege...

ES:
Los pétalos de cerezo caen como si
fueran pétalos de nieve, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}¡No es mala idea llevar paraguas!

{{TAG:0003:0004:}}¡Qué envidia verte con ese globo!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}No solo eres un chico joven de
aspecto, sino {{TAG:0003:0015:}}también de espíritu,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Du spielst mit Luftballons?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Damit siehst du gleich wieder wie
ein kleiner Junge aus...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Gefällt mir gut, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

